 Give AI a record of how work actually gets done 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 AI can't use institutional intelligence it doesn’t have. Companies need to capture how work gets done in a form AI can act on.


 The idea: Smartsheet connects teams, workflows and AI, helping turn that organizational context into action.


